bluejetty:00078067:ios.description:
Do you need to find your lost watch, phone or other Bluetooth device? Our app will handle this problem and will help you quickly find your lost device!
To do this, just open the app and select the device that has been lost. The app will find the location of the lost device itself and will estimate the distance to it. You will only have to follow the radar; the readings of the distance indicators will change as you approach the lost device. Also, you will be notified by the corresponding scanner signal when approaching it.
An important condition is that the lost device must be on and charged. A Bluetooth signal is required to locate the device.
Our app also allows you to test the sound of your devices. The app generates sound at frequencies ranging from 0 to 25,000 Hz, which allows you to test the speaker at specified frequencies.
KEY FEATURES:
• Shows all Bluetooth devices around you;
• Estimates the distance between you and the chosen device;
• Works both indoors and outdoors;
• Device loss notification;
• Bluetooth device renaming;
• Instantly tests speaker performance.
SUPPORTED DEVICES:
• All Bluetooth devices;
• Bluetooth headphone and portable speakers;
• Bluetooth smart watches and sports watches;
• Many other Bluetooth devices.
With our app you will find lost devices quickly and easily!
You can purchase an auto-renewable subscription to get full access. Your subscription will be charged to your iTunes account at confirmation of purchase. The subscription automatically renews for the same price and the duration period depends on the selected plan (weekly, monthly, yearly) unless canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can turn off the auto-renewal feature at any time by changing your account settings.
Please choose from our standard subscription options below: 1-week subscription at $3.99; 1-month subscription at $6.99; 12-month subscription at $9.99.
Privacy Policy: https://appliks.com/privacy-policy
Terms of Use: https://appliks.com/terms-of-use

